<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Adaptec EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Adaptec EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial Group analyst Scott Randall said on Monday he had raised his 1997 earnings-per-share (EPS) estimate for Adaptec Inc to $1.73 from $1.66.</p>
<p>-- In a statement, Randall also raised his 1998 EPS estimate to $2.15 from $2.05 and his 1999 estimate to $2.63 from $2.50.</p>
<p>-- Ratings remained unchanged at short-term buy and long-term hold.</p>
<p>-- Adaptec's shares rose 1-5/8 to 45-3/8 in late-morning trade.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
